      "Whizzing Edge": {
        "category": "ultimate",
        "description": {
          "raw": "Passive. Sinbad's skills also deal normal attack damage and his casting speed is affected by both his ATK SPD and Haste. Active. Sinbad lands as many hits as possible on the enemy over the next 3s, dealing 100% (ATK-based) + 15% (SP-based) damage per hit. After these successive attacks, he delivers one final strike that deals 240% (ATK-based) damage.",
