            "Both debuffs expire when their respective marks expire.",
            "When a marked enemy is defeated or when the marks expire, Sinbad starts to assess his enemies again and becomes unaffected during this time.",
            "The debuffs are reduces to 20% of the original effect when used against Bosses."
